    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious world of Knob! You play as Knob, a spherical creature with two wobbly antennae and the guardian of his homeland. But an unknown, advanced technology is threatening his peaceful home. The natural world is changing, and mechanical ruins are appearing everywhere. Your mission: uncover the mystery behind this technology and save your world from destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge traps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/cb1bc3514ae8f9495ab067131aa24e72.poster.avif?t=1742681900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/cb1bc3514ae8f9495ab067131aa24e72.webm?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/cb1bc3514ae8f9495ab067131aa24e72.mp4?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/522311475feaab14cc1868f3e4df45d4.poster.avif?t=1742681900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/522311475feaab14cc1868f3e4df45d4.webm?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/522311475feaab14cc1868f3e4df45d4.mp4?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/06f16381c158988507836cc25162b8ff.poster.avif?t=1742681900\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/06f16381c158988507836cc25162b8ff.webm?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478130/extras/06f16381c158988507836cc25162b8ff.mp4?t=1742681900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
